# Lit demo pages

- Demo pages live under `demo/` and root `index.html` / `index-all-in-one.html`.
- **UGA Online Design System:** https://design.online.uga.edu/getting-started/installation/
  - CSS: `https://design.online.uga.edu/css/base.css` (prefer **versioned** URLs in production).
  - JS: `https://design.online.uga.edu/js/scripts.js` before `</body>`.
  - Google Fonts: Merriweather, Merriweather Sans, Oswald as documented.
- Full pages: skip link, `<main id="main-content">`, `obj-reading-width` where appropriate.
- Load the component bundle with `<script type="module" src="...">` consistent with other demos.
- Do not break relative paths used for local `npm run dev` / preview.
